---
source: crates/safix/src/reporter.rs
expression: render_plain(&refusal)
---
safix: freebsd has no sandbox backend, so no generator ran.

The envelope a generator's fragments run inside is bubblewrap on linux
and /usr/bin/sandbox-exec on darwin, which is the pair clan's own
executor uses and the pair a fragment written for either system meets.
This platform has neither, and there is no flag that runs a generator
outside the envelope.
